      "sneeze-sdk":    { "url": "https://github.com/MetaversalCorp/SneezeSDK.git",      "folder": "SneezeSDK",     "ref": "main", "comment": "Tracks main. Sneeze HostFunctions.cpp requires the FABRIC node-tree + SERVICES ABI (kSNEEZE_ABI_METHOD_SERVICES_*, kSNEEZE_ABI_METHOD_FABRIC_NODE_*, SNEEZE_ABI_MAP_SERVICE) from include/sneeze_abi.h. Was formerly pinned to fe051d139 ('Assembly Fixes'), but main gets rewritten/force-pushed and orphaned SHAs break fresh shallow clones (Mac/Linux CI: 'fatal: unable to read tree'). Tracking main keeps CI cloning the live branch tip. -Sync fast-forwards to latest main." },
